ei19 spearheading> the <ei20 development> of the Multimedia Super Corridor ( MSC ) project . The application will <ei21 create> the necessary framework and infrastructure to <ei22 support> electronic commerce ( e-commerce ) <ei23 initiatives> in the country . However , it is important to note that <ei24 installing> or <ei25 implementing> Internet technologies for technology 's sake would not <ei26 ensure> instant <ei27 success> . For e-commerce to <ei28 flourish> with full-blown end-to-end business <ei29 transactions> , strategic <ei30 planning> which incorporates both business and technology plans that are complementary is necessary for an organisation to <ei31 see> feasible returns on investment . Intranets , through the use of Internet technology , are <ei32 positioned> as a platform for companies to <ei33 optimise> , <ei34 expand> and <ei35 transform> new channels of business . When strategically <ei36 implemented> , an intranet solution will <ei37 provide> the ability to <ei38 mediate> mission-critical , decision support functions in organisations . It will also <ei39 help> further <ei40 improve> communications and collaboration at all levels in an organisation . With intranets in place , it is only logical for organisations to respectively <ei41 link> the network to other companies ' for extended business purposes through extranets . While this will <ei42 enable> the sharing of information among enterprises , security issues such as firewalls and encryption as well as access and control procedures , and the trust levels that enterprises have with each other will <ei43 emerge> and there will be a need to <ei44 address> them . Other than <ei45 usage> in business , Internet technology is also <ei46 beginning> to <ei47 infiltrate> the lifestyle domain . \" Smart homes \" have <ei48 emerged> <ei49 bringing> a wealth of information and entertainment to families over telecommunications lines . The art of socialising is also <ei50 experiencing> a <ei51 change> where Net / virtual relationships are fast <ei52 overtaking> or <ei53 becoming> parallel with the normal human relationships . Whether this would <ei54 prove> positive or otherwise towards society in the future is yet to be <ei56 seen> . All in all , the Internet <ei57 has> a lot to <ei58 offer> . However , its value and benefits are only as good as how we <ei59 use> it .", "gold": [["ei4", "causes", "ei6"], ["ei24", "causes", "ei27"], ["ei25", "causes", "ei27"], ["ei30", "causes", "ei31"], ["ei6", "causedby", "ei4"], ["ei27", "causedby", "ei24"], ["ei27", "causedby", "ei25"], ["ei31", "causedby", "ei30"]], "lang": "eng", "mentions": ["ei1", "ei2", "ei4", "ei5", "ei6", "ei7", "ei8", "ei9", "ei10", "ei11", "ei12", "ei13", "ei14", "ei15", "ei16", "ei17", "ei18", "ei19", "ei20", "ei21", "ei22", "ei23", "ei24", "ei25", "ei26", "ei27", "ei28", "ei29", "ei30", "ei31", "ei32", "ei33", "ei34", "ei35", "ei36", "ei37", "ei38", "ei39", "ei40", "ei41", "ei42", "ei43", "ei44", "ei45", "ei46", "ei47", "ei48", "ei49", "ei50", "ei51", "ei52", "ei53", "ei54", "ei56", "ei57", "ei58", "ei59"], "surfaces": {"ei1": "move", "ei2": "come", "ei4": "convergence", "ei5": "coming", "ei6": "set", "ei7": "seize", "ei8": "transform", "ei9": "become", "ei10": "reaching", "ei11": "extending", "ei12": "include", "ei13": "opening", "ei14": "create", "ei15": "add", "ei16": "become", "ei17": "gain", "ei18": "developing", "ei19": "spearheading", "ei20": "development", "ei21": "create", "ei22": "support", "ei23": "initiatives", "ei24": "installing", "ei25": "implementing", "ei26": "ensure", "ei27": "success", "ei28": "flourish", "ei29": "transactions", "ei30": "planning", "ei31": "see", "ei32": "positioned", "ei33": "optimise", "ei34": "expand", "ei35": "transform", "ei36": "implemented", "ei37": "provide", "ei38": "mediate", "ei39": "help", "ei40": "improve", "ei41": "link", "ei42": "enable", "ei43": "emerge", "ei44": "address", "ei45": "usage", "ei46": "beginning", "ei47": "infiltrate", "ei48": "emerged", "e